{"noun":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/1d/85/17529_crt_0dRZE.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/1d/85/17529_crt_0dRZE.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/1d/85/17529_crt_0dRZE.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/1d/85/17529_crt_0dRZE.jpg"},"name":"モブキャラクター","summary":"闲角，常称作路人，在电视剧、电影等作品中，指戏份薄弱的副角、不相关的小人物、串场的闲杂人等。可能用来表达地方民众的声音，或是充当背景。\r\nモブキャラクター（mob character）とは、漫画、アニメ、映画、コンピュータゲームなどに描かれる端役のこと。群衆（群集）、または主要キャラクター以外の、その他大勢のこと。群集キャラ、背景キャラともいう。","relation":"闲角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/1e/9b/7211_prsn_cC9FA.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/1e/9b/7211_prsn_cC9FA.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/1e/9b/7211_prsn_cC9FA.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/1e/9b/7211_prsn_cC9FA.jpg"},"name":"阿杰","short_summary":"张杰，配音演员，又名ketsu，阿杰。1978年出生，北京人，729声工场（729配音组声创联盟）创始人。他的声音清朗华丽，跨度宽广，可适应多种不同声音年龄及个性。\r\n\r\n2006年，经著名配音演员姜广涛引荐，进入北京配音圈，第一次参与的电视剧作品是《明宫谜案》。2010年加入光合积木配音组，2016年退出光合积木，创办729声工场。","career":["seiyu"],"id":7211,"type":1,"locked":false},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/f7/be/31979_prsn_6v2vF.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/f7/be/31979_prsn_6v2vF.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/f7/be/31979_prsn_6v2vF.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/f7/be/31979_prsn_6v2vF.jpg"},"name":"张馨予","short_summary":"配音演员‖主持人‖二次元是自由人‖","career":["seiyu"],"id":31979,"type":1,"locked":false},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/de/f8/32636_prsn_2dyR0.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/de/f8/32636_prsn_2dyR0.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/de/f8/32636_prsn_2dyR0.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/de/f8/32636_prsn_2dyR0.jpg"},"name":"郭浩然","short_summary":"郭浩然，中国男性配音演员，石家庄人，现居北京。音色稳重温柔，适应性和可塑性强，擅长演绎各类型青中年男性角色。\r\n\r\n2015年，毕业于吉林艺术学院播音主持专业影视配音方向。2017年，加入729声工场，2021年5月20日结婚。","career":["seiyu"],"id":32636,"type":1,"locked":false},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/7d/27/39338_prsn_PrFg6.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/7d/27/39338_prsn_PrFg6.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/7d/27/39338_prsn_PrFg6.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/7d/27/39338_prsn_PrFg6.jpg"},"name":"音匣老鬼","short_summary":"网配CV出身，原木成配音工作室成员，后加入729声工场。代表作剑网三官方boss阿萨辛，啦啦啦德玛西亚超神学院嘉文等。\r\n\r\n2018年底，因为“鬼”会被渣浪屏蔽，无奈只好改名为“关帅”。","career":["seiyu"],"id":39338,"type":1,"locked":false},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/85/5e/40191_prsn_mQEE8.jpg?r=1718785873","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/85/5e/40191_prsn_mQEE8.jpg?r=1718785873","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/85/5e/40191_prsn_mQEE8.jpg?r=1718785873","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/85/5e/40191_prsn_mQEE8.jpg?r=1718785873"},"name":"聂曦映","short_summary":"中国女配音演员，江西九江人，毕业于四川传媒学院。\r\n\r\n网配CV出身，曾用艺名洛洛清茗。2017年在729声工场培训，2019年加入729声工场。","career":["seiyu"],"id":40191,"type":1,"locked":false},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/a4/25/42098_prsn_9uTwX.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/a4/25/42098_prsn_9uTwX.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/a4/25/42098_prsn_9uTwX.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/a4/25/42098_prsn_9uTwX.jpg"},"name":"张福正","short_summary":"中国男性配音演员，内蒙古巴彦淖尔人。声音沉稳清亮，音色温柔清冷，声线可塑性较强，常为少年、青年男性角色配音。\r\n\r\n网配CV出身，因为《狐妖小红娘》开始接触配音。2017年加入729声工场。他还是一位宅舞、女团爱好者，最喜欢的女团是Perfume。","career":["seiyu"],"id":42098,"type":1,"locked":false},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/d3/3c/44013_prsn_pzQ2z.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/d3/3c/44013_prsn_pzQ2z.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/d3/3c/44013_prsn_pzQ2z.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/d3/3c/44013_prsn_pzQ2z.jpg"},"name":"蔡海婷","short_summary":"中国配音演员，网络配音出身。现居北京。","career":["seiyu"],"id":44013,"type":1,"locked":false},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/70/84/53229_prsn_tIrt0.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/70/84/53229_prsn_tI